Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:09.43,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,The teachers keep droning on about studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:11.28,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,We've only just started middle school!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:16.35,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your voice was my only solace \Nas I lay in bed late at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:20.28,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,What high school do you want to go to, Apollo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:20.71,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NOW STREAMING\NMIDNIGHT HEART TUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.66,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:25.17,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Gotta be an all-girls' school. \NHopefully one with an ocean view.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:37.81,Main,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\an8}TUNE IN TO THE MIDNIGHT HEART
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:48.44,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:54.24,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,Ahem. As mew're—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:01:00.86,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,As you're all aware, Furin Girls' has merged \Nwith Furin Boys' as of this academic year
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:02.12,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,and become a co-ed school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:05.52,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,I know having boys around \Nwill take some getting used to,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:06.72,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,but I hope you'll play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:07.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:10.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What was that "mew" thing all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:12.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did you flub your line?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:18.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That would render your speech imperfect. \NI demand a do-over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.12,0:01:20.98,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,And you are... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:23.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,May I take that to mean \NI can introduce myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.11,Main,CLASSTEACHER,0,0,0,,S-Sure, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.11,0:01:27.69,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}YAMABUKI ARISU
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.01,0:01:27.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The name's Yamabuki Arisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:31.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Heir to the Yamabuki Group, and a man \Nwho'll carry Japan into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:34.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,As such, I am destined to be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:35.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My favorite food is peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:40.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I ask that you all try to avoid being \Ncrushed by my sheer aura and gravitas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:44.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:49.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Alas, I regret to inform you that \NI am only 99% perfect at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.48,0:01:51.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,To find that missing one percent\Nthat will make me whole,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I need some help from the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:58.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'd like you all to take turns...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:02.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and say "I love you" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.94,0:02:07.73,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Damn it, Yamabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:11.39,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,You've got the girls \Nlooking at all us boys funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:13.31,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Quit doing that to every girl you see!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.31,0:02:15.36,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,We finally got out of all-boys hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:18.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Adversity builds character, as they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:25.34,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Say, the Yamabuki Group is loaded, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:28.13,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,What's up with that "I love you" stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:33.74,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Are you looking for a girlfriend? \NI'd like to apply for the role.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.96,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa, already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:39.26,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,F-Fine, bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:43.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Lacking a bit of carrying power, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:46.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Apologies. It's bathroom time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:50.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Since my intestinal flora \Nare as perfect as the rest of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:53.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I am in the enviable position of having \Nnature call at the same time every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.76,0:02:55.61,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Yeah, I dunno about enviable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:57.07,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,What is with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:58.12,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.39,0:03:01.90,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,He's been looking for someone \Nsince the second year of middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.90,0:03:04.70,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,But he doesn't know what she looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:06.44,Main,F. STUDENT,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:08.65,Main,F. STUDENT2,0,0,0,,And get this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.54,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Doesn't have the same kind of edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:13.30,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,All he's got to go on...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.04,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,is her voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:20.85,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MESSAGE FROM MOTHER: I GOT A PERM! HERE'S A PIC!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.86,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a text from Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:27.77,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WAITING FOR THE STREAM TO BEGIN...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.52,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}APOLLO HAS STARTED STREAMING\N"MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:29.52,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.93,0:03:32.42,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,My only joy back in middle school
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:35.24,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,was a radio show hosted by a girl \Nwho went by the name "Apollo."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:38.99,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Welcome to Midnight Heart Tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:41.74,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Guess what happened at school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.66,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She barely had any listeners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.24,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,At times, it was just the two of us chatting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:50.38,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,We'd make small talk every night at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.77,0:03:53.59,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time. That's all for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.75,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She always ended her show \Nwith the same phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:02.22,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,This show keeps me going every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.22,0:04:04.35,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Come hang out with me again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.65,0:04:06.18,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Thanks as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.27,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,My dear listeners...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.27,0:04:09.31,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.61,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you wanted to hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.41,0:04:17.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And you are...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:19.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Break time's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.66,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Didn't you need to go to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.68,0:04:26.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:33.23,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her voice was very similar to Apollo's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:34.63,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I think!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:39.05,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,But I can't be sure. She caught me unawares \Nand at the mercy of nature's call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:41.62,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Damn it! I need to hear it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:50.31,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This is the broadcasting club \Nwith your lunchtime announcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.71,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Here's to another great year together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.71,0:04:58.68,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,First-years, and our new male students, \Nit's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:53.48,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Whoa, a girl's voice \Ncoming through the speakers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.48,0:04:55.22,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,But the sound quality kind of sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:56.64,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Their equipment must be ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:58.68,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Gotta love co-ed, huh, Yamabuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Something came up! I must take your leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:03.82,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Hey, what about lunch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:02.33,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The broadcasting club will be coming to you \Nat lunch and after school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:04.97,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,bringing you news on school events,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.97,0:05:07.50,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,club activities, and committee announcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.03,0:05:11.67,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,First, an announcement \Nfrom the student council.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:13.29,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With our school now co-ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:13.29,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Apollo abruptly stopped streaming\Nby the end of the first year of middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:16.00,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE\NTHIS CHANNEL DOESN'T HAVE ANY CONTENT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.00,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She also deleted all her archives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:21.51,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,But I knew from our chats that we were the \Nsame age and lived in the same prefecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:23.55,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She also said...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:27.22,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,she'd like to go to an all-girls \Nhigh school with an ocean view!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.98,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I estimated her location \Nbased on her activities,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:34.60,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,and upon further investigation, \Nonly Furin Girls' matched the criteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:37.22,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I also caught wind that \Nit'd be turning co-ed soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.22,0:05:41.61,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's why I chose to go to \NFurin Boys' instead of a prep school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.90,0:05:45.66,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sometimes my own brilliance frightens me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.16,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:50.41,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:54.63,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to talk to you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:56.96,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:00.25,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I need one last percent to make me whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.18,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,And that is your...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:15.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,M-My apologies. \NThere's something I want to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:20.03,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't waltz in here \Nwhile we're broadcasting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:21.49,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Mute the mic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.49,0:06:23.24,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What? Do we have to start over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:26.34,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey, it's the guy who almost \Nsoiled himself in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:28.17,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You know him, Rikka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:30.30,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You okay? You hit your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:33.91,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,This is why I didn't like the co-ed idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.91,0:06:35.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:39.42,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, she really does sound like Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:43.48,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,The thing is... they all kinda sound like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:47.23,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Braids has the same kind of voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:51.26,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Black Hair has familiar intonation \Nand pronunciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:54.60,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,White Hair's whispery way of speaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:58.40,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's just like when she streamed in a \Nhushed voice so her parents wouldn't notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:01.94,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,And Twintails has the exact \Nsame kind of angry tone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:06.67,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Curses. How has a mere three-year gap \Nleft me feeling so unsure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:07.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:10.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,since you're here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:12.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,...does that mean you want to go pro, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whatever do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:15.37,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:17.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why are you here if you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:22.00,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We all wanna pursue a career with our voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:26.02,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,The broadcasting club is specifically \Nfor people like us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.02,0:07:27.05,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:30.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to be an anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.55,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,My dream is to be a VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.13,0:07:36.43,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm looking to be a voice actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:39.95,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I want to be a singer, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:45.07,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,A career with their voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:47.24,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I've heard of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:50.76,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Rumor has it you did one crazy self-intro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:52.19,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:56.37,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"Be my lover and bear my child," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Th-That is not what I—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:07:59.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What the hell? You creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.83,0:08:02.63,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You even look like a total degenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:05.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I bet you filled your \Ncloud storage with dick pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,False! I'm here to see someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.09,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Would that be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:15.57,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I talked \Nto a boy in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.57,0:08:18.45,Main,IKON,0,0,0,,Being shy is part of my character and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.45,0:08:21.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, no, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:23.00,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're here to see me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:26.94,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:31.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Exactly. I came here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:36.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I swear on the Yamabuki name \Nthat I have no ulterior motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I simply wanted to see you again \Nand hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:40.51,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,O-Okay...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.51,0:08:43.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If anyone here is Apollo, raise your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:46.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:47.82,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,The chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's one of my favorites!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.34,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:53.70,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Huh? Apollo isn't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:58.64,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,No, based on their voices, \Nit has to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.01,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.69,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Apollo doesn't want to reveal herself?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:07.15,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE\NTHIS CHANNEL DOESN'T HAVE ANY CONTENT
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.15,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It might have something to do \Nwith why she quit streaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:10.94,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Shoot! I shouldn't have asked them directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:12.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.55,0:09:15.30,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We need to get back to our broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:16.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.81,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,No matter. I'll have plenty \Nof chances to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.43,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Outsiders aren't allowed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.43,0:09:28.80,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Never approach us again, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.34,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:34.82,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I want to get a voice-related job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:37.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I am a veritable expert in voice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:39.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That makes me a pro myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thus, I have the right to join this club.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:44.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,To prove it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:47.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,allow me to enlighten you \Non this club's critical flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:49.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.91,0:09:54.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There was so much noise in your broadcast \Nthat it was unbearable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:56.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And you want to be pros? Laughable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.63,0:09:58.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I mean, not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.78,0:10:00.86,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This school's practically ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:02.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Here's my proposal to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:05.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you let me, Yamabuki Arisu, join this club,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:08.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll contribute with brand-new equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:12.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You see, yours truly made around \Na million yen in the stock market last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.10,0:10:16.71,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.71,0:10:18.39,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:20.72,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Might be nice to have some man-power around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.73,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Are you okay with this, Rikka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.73,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah. I like his voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:29.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:31.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll lead this club to greater \Nheights as your president.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:34.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, who died and made you boss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.25,0:10:35.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Rikka's our president!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:37.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How do we repay him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:41.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But he's loaded. \NWhat could he possibly want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.25,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I know of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.67,0:10:44.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.02,0:10:50.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.97,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Costs us nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.97,0:10:53.66,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Would that even count as repaying him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.20,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't really mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun, could you turn around for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:06.85,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,I love you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:08.56,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wh-Where did that come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:13.64,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Didn't you want us to say that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:15.05,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What a creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:17.20,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Made my heart race a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:21.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,O-Oh, right! I must take my leave, \Nfor I have yet to finish my lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:30.42,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to meet Apollo again like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:33.21,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I guess it was just you and me again, Arisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:35.09,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Thanks for tuning in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.09,0:11:38.86,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,My dear listeners, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:41.31,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was just her usual sign-off phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.52,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank you too, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:46.22,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,And hey, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:50.94,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I love you, too. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:58.36,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I declared my love to a girl \NI knew nothing about!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:02.37,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,A blunder most unbecoming of a Yamabuki \Nwho's meant to embody perfection!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:04.87,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,If she has a local copy of her archives,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:08.00,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I need her to delete that at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:12.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't have it used as blackmail \Nmaterial after I've made it big.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:14.88,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:14.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I have to identify Apollo \Nas soon as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:19.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and retract those words I said back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.97,0:12:22.97,Main,TITLE SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS HAS BEEN YAMABUKI ARISU
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.43,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.60,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)\NWELCOMING A NEW MEMBER
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:27.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Here's to Yamabuki Arisu-kun \Njoining the broadcasting club!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.81,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's get this welcome party started!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Take it away, our guest of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:38.82,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Tell us how you feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:43.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This gracious welcome truly \Nwarms the cockles of my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:45.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.08,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Well, better make yourself useful,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:50.13,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Errand boy? Who, yours truly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.28,0:12:55.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Our club advisor was against a boy joining us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:58.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,She only approved it on the condition \Nthat you be the errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:00.84,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Do you hate doing chores, Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:02.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"Bucky"? What's up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.74,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't lose sight of your goal, Yamabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:10.15,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Our top priority is to find Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:13.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay. Errand boy is fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whatever it may be, I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:30.79,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:32.79,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NOTES
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.79,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:35.93,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll start by observing the four girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:41.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is it just you today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:44.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,They're all free spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,My script for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:51.56,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I tend to flub my lines, \Nso I've marked potential issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:57.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Say, Uzuki. May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.15,0:13:58.48,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.04,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:04.74,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:08.08,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki Shinobu, aspiring anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:12.00,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's also the student council vice president, \Nand your typical honor student.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:16.06,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her bright and cheerful personality \Nhas made her the school's princess of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:20.76,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is your after-school broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.76,0:14:25.16,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,The music room is currently \Noff-limits due to repair work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.11,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Please be sure to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:30.44,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her voice rings as clear as a silver bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:34.52,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,With our newly co-ed school's baseball team \Nmaking its regional tournament de-butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:38.82,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,the wind ensemble pree-sident and the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.56,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,and cheer-reading... cheer... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:44.15,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You catch my drift. Do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.79,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,You flubbed every single word you marked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.65,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:53.25,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Are you stupid, Yamabuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:55.59,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,That's what makes Uzuki-san so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:57.53,Main,MIURA,0,0,0,,Isn't she just so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:59.35,Main,EDANO,0,0,0,,Love the contrast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:07.76,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}UZUKI SHINOBU, CLASS 2-D
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.80,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uzuki can go on the backburner for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:07.76,Main,TANAKA,0,0,0,,Nene-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.76,0:15:09.99,Main,TANAKA,0,0,0,,You got the new {\i1}Lilycos{\i0} volume, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:12.06,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Of course I did! I'm an OG fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:15.56,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,{\i0}Lilycos{\i1}? Apollo loved that manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:19.38,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Himekawa Nene, aspiring voice actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:22.14,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I hear she's also an avid cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:24.65,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's a real go-getter \Nand the life of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:26.91,Main,WAKAO,0,0,0,,Hey, voice Lily in this scene for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:29.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Just a little, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:30.95,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:36.71,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"I can finally hear your voice again."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:39.79,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"I've been waiting for so, so long."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:41.01,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Squee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:42.26,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Just like the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:46.95,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"My father's s... sp... spectator?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:49.32,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,You mean "specter."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.59,0:15:52.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MY FATHER'S SPECTER MUST HAVE LED YOU TO ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:52.56,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,A spectator is someone in the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:55.77,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"Even if I am to invoke God's horny wrath..."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.72,0:15:56.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}EVEN IF I AM TO INVOKE GOD'S HOLY WRATH...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:56.74,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,Holy wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:59.31,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THE WIND HAS BEEN TAKEN OUT OF MY SAILS!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.31,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"Out of my... tails?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:15:59.31,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,Sails.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:01.65,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Something tells me she's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:03.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Urk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,No! I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:09.59,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That boy over there's been \Nogling me all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:10.39,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:11.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Uh, I did no such...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:14.13,Main,TANAKA,0,0,0,,Hey, keep it in your pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:15.13,Main,WAKAO,0,0,0,,You pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:18.83,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,You want your balls electrocuted, jerkwad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:31.27,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't figure it out from their voices, \Nprobably because I was listening to a stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:33.97,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ELECTRONIC SIGNAL
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:35.72,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SAMPLING
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.39,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DIGITIZING
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.39,0:16:42.40,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ENCODING
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:33.99,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Namely, the hybrid encoding method.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:37.86,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Since sending your real voice takes \Na lot of bandwidth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:42.40,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,it's digitized and a voice pattern closest \Nto the original is sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:46.93,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,In other words, a voice out of a phone is one \Nthat merely resembles the original.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:45.57,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:50.64,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,As such, I'll have to figure it out \Nby what they say and do instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:53.66,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Which means I'll have to \Nobserve them more closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.70,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You want to observe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:01.92,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sorry, my colored contacts are purely cosmetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.98,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I can't see unless I get real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.88,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Kirino Iko, aspiring VTuber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:11.82,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,The club's resident tech support, \Nand hugely popular among the otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.82,0:17:13.31,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,According to the boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:17.72,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,she's currently pioneering a new \N"assertive shy girl" archetype.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:18.79,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't even.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.98,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}KIRINO IKO, CLASS 2-B
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:21.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:25.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,This place is reserved for my streams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:36.35,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko! I'm Ikonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.79,0:17:40.58,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sumeragi Ikon here! Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.58,0:17:45.59,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}HELLO-IKO!\NYOU'RE AS CUTE AS EVER TODAY!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:42.13,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:43.19,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.36,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hello-Iko...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:45.59,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bye-Iko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.59,0:17:46.46,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THIS STREAM HAS ENDED
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.50,0:17:48.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:51.12,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I mean, it's a break-time stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:52.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And you think that's fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:57.06,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I mean, it makes my viewers happy, \Nso that's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.41,0:18:00.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:11.82,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Did Iko... Did I do something to upset him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:16.32,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,What an unserious club!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:19.04,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I haven't even seen the aspiring singer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.25,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:24.12,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I want to get a voice-related job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:28.28,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Like voice actress or TV anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.28,0:18:32.13,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Being a singer sounds nice, too. And I think \NVTubing's about to hit the big-time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:35.11,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I know you can do it, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.61,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:40.39,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:45.56,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll learn all about voice work, so I can \Nhelp you with whatever career you pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.15,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,It's a promise, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:49.57,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I'll work like my life's on the line too,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:52.40,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,so let's go see the pro world together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:57.76,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who took \Nthat promise seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.60,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,This is your after-school broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.60,0:19:09.05,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Question from the British \NKarao—Karate Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.05,0:19:11.14,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,"Do the four of you have boyfriends?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.59,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.59,0:19:14.02,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.02,0:19:17.04,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bad girl, Rikka. You're slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.97,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm just not feeling motivated right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:24.34,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wonder what Yamabuki-kun thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:25.22,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,About us, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:30.98,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:32.75,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Fellow students!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:35.78,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Would you agree that the broadcasting club \Ndoesn't cut it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:41.02,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun, we're live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.77,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you moron?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:44.91,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Here in this countryside public school,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:47.79,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,if these girls continue to neglect \Nputting in any real effort
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:50.69,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,and let you all give them \Nthe princess treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:53.80,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,their dreams will never come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:56.42,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,But worry not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:20:01.22,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,If Apollo has forgotten about our promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:03.89,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,then I'll just have to make her remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:06.56,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,And if I don't know which \None of them is Apollo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:09.37,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,then I'll just have to make \Nall their dreams come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.54,0:20:17.15,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Any club that I, perfection incarnate, \Nam part of must be as perfect as I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:21.53,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,I declare here and now that I will guide all \Nthe members of the broadcasting club
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:24.29,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,and turn them into true professionals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:26.93,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Be it an anchor at a flagship TV station,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.36,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,a Billboard-charting singer,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.93,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,a top voice actress,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:32.32,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,or a VTuber with the most \Nconcurrent viewers ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:37.60,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've come to fulfill our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.72,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now it's up to you to give me an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:40.97,Broadcast,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's all from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.27,0:20:43.95,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Get outta here, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.82,0:20:53.68,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We resume your after-school broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.68,0:20:56.73,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Since we're here, \Nyou'll hear from all four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:59.33,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,We've got a ton of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.11,0:21:02.75,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Mom again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:08.79,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}APOLLO HAS STARTED STREAMING\N"MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:11.65,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Leave the tongue twister to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:13.83,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.59,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.87,0:21:21.99,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I nearly had a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:26.16,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd come to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:28.57,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.09,0:21:33.00,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I can't tell you that I'm Apollo.\N Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:37.90,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ARISU: I'M HERE AS ALWAYS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:37.90,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,While I always lamented \Nhow few listeners I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.90,0:21:42.37,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,the truth is, just having you there \Nwas good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:46.04,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I was happy just being able to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:49.37,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,When I said "I love you"...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.68,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,It's got a lot of big words, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.68,0:21:56.00,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:22:00.17,Italics,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I meant it for you and you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:05.26,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Okay, take turns and let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:06.93,Broadcast,ALL,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.40,0:22:13.40,Main,Credits Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}TRANSLATION: SRIRAM GURUNATHAN\NTIMING: MARIANA MARTINEZ\NEDITING: WILLIAM HAGGARD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:15.40,Main,Credits Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8}QUALITY CHECK: S BILYEU\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
